    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530-a2">

                <pb facs="0537" n="1271" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1271"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 588.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Gibson.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Christie matter attended to. Porte sent instructions to vali at Beirut to
                    investigate and prosecute guilty parties. Investigate yourself all the facts.
                    Were the natives Moslems or Christians! Report cause of the attack and whether
                    the parties beaten were Christians or Moslems.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
